# MyPatientHUB

A responsive healthcare dashboard where users can find doctors, clinics, pharmacies, and manage appointments.

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Font Awesome
- Google Fonts

## Features

- Dashboard with promotion cards (Clinics, Pharmacies, Smart Market, Health Index)
- Sidebar navigation (Dashboard, Appointments, Find Doctor, Find Clinic, Chat, Find MarketPlace, Find Pharmacy, My Dependents, My Account, Settings)
- Search bar, notifications, settings, and account icons in header
- Log out button with alert message
- Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile

